allowed in addition to the paper's nonzero proper active case. -/
theorem homological_homogenization (I : Ideal (MvPolynomial V k))
    (hI : IsPolymatroidalIdeal I) (g : RankFunction V) (he : I = rankIdeal k g) :
    ∃ p : ℕ,
      p = shiftLength g ∧
